 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "All 7 old kinds kept. Alpine ski: 16 flat models turned into 9 line archetypes (Mantra, Enforcer, QST, Bent Chetler, Brahma, Mindbender, Supershape, Redster, Hero Elite) + 7 models; dropped Stance Pro 82/86 (covered by Stance range). Ski boot: dropped S/Pro Alpha C BOA, S/Pro Delta BOA, S/Pro Supra Dual BOA, S/Pro Supra S BOA, T4 (S/Pro range covers them); added Mach1 archetype and test-page models. Binding: dropped Evo 9 GW CA, MTN Summit 9, N Strive 16 MN, S/LAB Shift 2 10, Strive 10/14 Gripwalk (ranges cover). Helmet: dropped Rodeo. Not done: Lange, Atomic Hawx and Look Pivot archetypes, Experience/Kore/Racetiger/Bonafide/Elan/Fischer lines, helmet/goggle test winners - Blister pages 403 (also via Firecrawl) and no other retrieved page."
}